Minato's patch to frameworks/base's media/java/android/media/MediaFormat.java at android-15.0.0_r1 (Apache-2.0), the
Unity test APK gap sort, category 3m: the class as AOSP has it, with the four feature flags it names as local constants.

Why: MediaFormat is the key-value map that apps and SDKs fill with a codec's or a track's parameters, and it needs
no codec to work. It names four aconfig flags (FLAG_IN_PROCESS_SW_AUDIO_CODEC, FLAG_REGION_OF_INTEREST in package
android.media.codec; FLAG_CODEC_IMPORTANCE, FLAG_LARGE_AUDIO_FRAME in com.android.media.codec.flags) in @FlaggedApi
annotations by static imports of their generated Flags classes. Those flags are declared in frameworks/av, which
Minato does not fetch, so the imports do not resolve. The annotations are only markers (source retention), so
constants with the flags' names are enough. The values are those of Android 15's core/api/current.txt, which gives
each flag's name in @FlaggedApi ("android.media.codec.region_of_interest" and the others).

--- a/media/java/android/media/MediaFormat.java
+++ b/media/java/android/media/MediaFormat.java
@@ -16,12 +16,6 @@
 
 package android.media;
 
-import static android.media.codec.Flags.FLAG_IN_PROCESS_SW_AUDIO_CODEC;
-import static android.media.codec.Flags.FLAG_REGION_OF_INTEREST;
-
-import static com.android.media.codec.flags.Flags.FLAG_CODEC_IMPORTANCE;
-import static com.android.media.codec.flags.Flags.FLAG_LARGE_AUDIO_FRAME;
-
 import android.annotation.FlaggedApi;
 import android.annotation.IntDef;
 import android.annotation.NonNull;
@@ -155,6 +149,15 @@
  * </table>
  */
 public final class MediaFormat {
+    // Minato: four feature flags of the media codec packages (android.media.codec and com.android.media.codec.flags),
+    // whose aconfig declarations are in frameworks/av and not fetched, as constants of this class instead of the static
+    // imports of their generated Flags classes. The values are the flag names that Android 15's public API
+    // (core/api/current.txt) gives in @FlaggedApi.
+    private static final String FLAG_IN_PROCESS_SW_AUDIO_CODEC = "android.media.codec.in_process_sw_audio_codec";
+    private static final String FLAG_REGION_OF_INTEREST = "android.media.codec.region_of_interest";
+    private static final String FLAG_CODEC_IMPORTANCE = "com.android.media.codec.flags.codec_importance";
+    private static final String FLAG_LARGE_AUDIO_FRAME = "com.android.media.codec.flags.large_audio_frame";
+
     public static final String MIMETYPE_VIDEO_VP8 = "video/x-vnd.on2.vp8";
     public static final String MIMETYPE_VIDEO_VP9 = "video/x-vnd.on2.vp9";
     public static final String MIMETYPE_VIDEO_AV1 = "video/av01";
